sound test

a browser-based audio testing tool for checking speakers, headphones, and microphones. built with svelte 5 and the [web audio api](https://www.w3.org/TR/webaudio-1.1/).

what you can do:
- figure out if you've got the left earbud in your right ear again.
- test if your speakers are wired correctly with a polarity check.
- see a live volume meter from your microphone.
- sweep from 20 hz to 20 khz to test your speaker's frequency range.

i built this because i keep trying to shove the wrong earbud in the wrong ear like an animal.